ersonalized web experience. Because we respect your right to privacy, you can choose not to allow some types of cookies. Click on the different category headings to find out more and change our default settings. Please note, however, that blocking some types of cookies may impact your experience of the website and the services we are able to offer. \\u003ca\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\\",\\"functional\\":{\\"description\\":\\"These cookies enable the website to provide enhanced functionality and personalization, improving your visit. They may be set by us or by a third party whose services we have added to our pages. They are used to remember your settings and whether we have already asked if you have read and understood our cookies notice. If you do not allow these cookies, then some or all of these services may not function properly.\\",\\"title\\":\\"Functional cookies\\"},\\"manage-preference\\":\\"Manage preference\\",\\"necessary\\":{\\"description\\":\\"These cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be switched off in our systems. They are usually set in response to actions made by you which amount to a request for services, such as setting your privacy preferences, logging in or remembering information on order forms. You can set your browser to block or alert you about these cookies, but some parts of the website will not work as a result. These cookies do not store any personally identifiable information.\\",\\"title\\":\\"Strictly necessary cookies\\"},\\"performance\\":{\\"description\\":\\"These cookies allow us to count visits and traffic sources so we can measure and improve the performance of our website. They help us to know which pages are the most and least popular and see how visitors move around the website. These cookies do not collect data that could identify you and are only used to help us improve our website and how it works. They also help us understand our users\' interests and measure our effectiveness.\\",\\"title\\":\\"Performance cookies\\"},\\"popup\\":{\\"description\\":\\"KICK and our partners use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized content, measure how the website is used, and for advertising, marketing and social media purposes. By clicking \\\\\\"Accept all\\\\\\", you consent to our use of cookies.\\",\\"title\\":\\"You are in control of cookies used\\"},\\"targeting\\":{\\"description\\":\\"These cookies are linked to services provided by us and/or third parties and may be set through our website by us and/or our advertising partners. They may be used by those companies to build a profile of your interests and show you relevant advertisements on our website and other websites. They may also be used for other advertising purposes including serving and rendering advertisements, frequency capping, tracking clicks, personalizing advertisements and any other research relating to serving advertisements. They do not store directly personal information, but are based on uniquely identifying your browser and internet device. These cookies are not necessary for the function of the website and you can choose to not allow them\\",\\"title\\":\\"Targeting cookies\\"},\\"title\\":\\"Cookie settings\\"},\\"reject\\":\\"Reject\\"},\\"MutedUsers\\":{\\"user_muted_error\\":\\"There was an error muting {username}. Please try again.\\",\\"user_muted_success\\":\\"User {username} has been muted!\\",\\"user_unmuted_error\\":\\"There was an error unmuting {username}. Please try again.\\",\\"user_unmuted_success\\":\\"User {username} has been unmuted!\\"},\\"Payments\\":\\"$8a:props:messages:Payments\\",\\"GenericError\\":{\\"default\\":\\"Unknown error. Please try again.\\"},\\"Footer\\":{\\"about_us\\":\\"About Us\\",\\"advertising_policy\\":\\"Advertising Policy\\",\\"bounties_terms_and_conditions\\":\\"Bounties Terms \\u0026 Conditions\\",\\"brand\\":\\"Brand\\",\\"careers\\":\\"Careers\\",\\"community_guidelines\\":\\"Community Guidelines\\",\\"company\\